{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ae568be9-5d84-843b-a09a-f88caf2c5b2c",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T12:42:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Celeste Andrade",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:39:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:39:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. Sure, I'm calling about a storm drain. The low spot at the end of my block is under water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:39:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can you tell me where you are? What's the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:39:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, it's 283 Dixon Street, in the North End. The water's at the end of the block, past my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:39:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "283 Dixon Street, North End. And you said the low spot at the end of the block. How deep are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:39:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, yeah, it's about a foot. Maybe a little over in the middle. It's been like that since the nor'easter, last weekend, Saturday into Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:40:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's been sitting since Sunday, two days now. And it hasn't gone down at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:40:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, no, sure, it goes down a little and then it's back. The drain is just full of leaves and, um, junk, I think. I can't really see it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:40:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So you think the drain is clogged with debris and the water has nowhere to go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:40:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly, yes. And there's an older neighbor on the street, she can't get out. Her car's on the other side of it and she can't walk through that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:40:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. Is she okay otherwise? Does she need anything urgent, like medical help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:40:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, she's fine, absolutely. She just can't get out right now. I'm bringing her groceries so she's all set."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:40:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'll note that on the request so they know there's someone stuck in. So what you're asking is for the drain at the end of Dixon Street to be cleaned out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:41:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, sure, please. If they could clean it, that would be great."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:41:19-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Let me read it back. Storm drain at the low spot at the end of the block by 283 Dixon Street, about a foot of water, clogged since the weekend storm, elderly neighbor unable to get out. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:41:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's right, of course."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:41:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a call back when it's been looked at? I can put a number on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:41:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, absolutely. It's 401-555-0197."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:41:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0197. Okay. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:41:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Celeste Andrade. A-N-D-R-A-D-E."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:41:57-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Celeste. I'll send this to the crew that does the drains. They're backed up with requests after the storm, so it may be a day or two before they get to your end of the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:42:14-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure, that's fine. Sorry, I'm on my lunch break and I've got to run, I just signed a permission slip for my kid's field trip to a museum and I have to drop it at the school."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:42:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, go ahead. If the water starts coming toward houses or the road becomes impassable, call us right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:42:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, I will. Thank you so much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:42:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care, Celeste."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:42:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye."
    }
  ],
